execnet==2.1.2
# pytest and what it requires, repeated from requirements-ci.in at the same
# versions (tests/test_manifests_agree.py compares them). pip-compile writes
# the whole tree under pytest-xdist into the output, and every package in an
# output has to be pinned in its input.
